{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55248","headline":"句 · 杜四郎","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十年来尘扑面，如今始得一涂（施元之注《苏东坡诗》《和张子野见寄三绝句》注引《小说》作「杴」）泥。\n（见曾慥《类说》卷二六《後史补》。\n）（〖1〗《後史补》云：「梁园有富家子杜四郎，好接文士，爱爲诗篇，时号杜荀鸭，以比荀鹤。\n每有诗即题壁，亲宾或污漫之，即云〖略〗。\n」《直斋书录解题》小说家类载《後史补》爲「前进士高欲拙擢」。\n因知四郎当爲唐末五代间人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜四郎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}